# Decrypted or in-flight IBKR Flex statements must never be committable here.
# This repo is public and Pages serves the whole personal_site directory; raw
# Flex XML carries the unmasked account id, every position, and every cash
# transaction -- precisely what mask_account() in
# scripts/ibkr-flex/fetch-ibkr.py exists to keep off the site.
#
# The archive itself lives in the private iamsuzerain/warehouse repo, encrypted.
# Nothing statement-shaped should ever appear in this tree; these rules are the
# backstop for a local run that points IBKR_FLEX_RAW_DIR inside the checkout.
*.xml.gz
warehouse/

# Local scratch. Not ignored until a `git add -A` in this session swept 479
# extracted PDF pages into a public repo; the rule is cheaper than remembering.
tmp/
